/*******************************
    User Variable Overrides
*******************************/
/* A field's label. Semantic gives it `@textColor`, a fixed rgba(0,0,0,.87),
   rather than anything the theme patch reaches, so in dark it is black on the
   dark modal -- "How often" on the watch dialog could not be read at all. The
   body colour falls back to the same `@textColor` in light, so light is
   unchanged. */
@labelColor: @bodyTextColor;
